            <ArticleTitle>Plasminogen activator inhibitor-1 and restenosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1003-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Despite the introduction of drug-eluting stents restenosis remains an important clinical problem. In this review we examine the role of plasminogen activator inhibitor-1 (PAI-1) in controlling restenosis after balloon angioplasty and stent implantation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
